cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Overtonium
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A 32-partial additive synthesiser laid out like a 32-channel mixer. Every
  channel is one sine oscillator locked to a harmonic of the played note, with
  its own tuning, envelope, modulation and pan. A continuous blend sweeps each
  partial between equal temperament and just intonation, and the keyboard
  underneath can be tuned to any of six historical temperaments on any root.
authors:
